[
{
"start": 13.67,
"end": 17.02,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "Linear is the issue tracker built for speed \u2013 designed for the keyboard.",
"char_start": 14,
"char_end": 86,
"unit_id": "t0002.u01",
"sent_id": "t0002.s02"
},
{
"start": 17.02,
"end": 18.0,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "Try linear.com today.",
"char_start": 87,
"char_end": 108,
"unit_id": "t0002.u01",
"sent_id": "t0002.s03"
},
{
"start": 18.0,
"end": 24.0,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "Before we get started, Stefan Brandt was on the show and mentioned that drainage is the design decision with the biggest impact.",
"char_start": 109,
"char_end": 237,
"unit_id": "t0002.u01",
"sent_id": "t0002.s04"
},
{
"start": 24.0,
"end": 25.24,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "Yes, exactly.",
"char_start": 252,
"char_end": 265,
"unit_id": "t0003.u01",
"sent_id": "t0003.s01"
},
{
"start": 25.24,
"end": 30.0,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "And that connects to what we are discussing today.",
"char_start": 266,
"char_end": 316,
"unit_id": "t0003.u01",
"sent_id": "t0003.s02"
},
{
"start": 30.0,
"end": 36.0,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "I'd like to point something out \u2013 Stefan Brandt mentioned a similar dynamic a few episodes ago.",
"char_start": 331,
"char_end": 426,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s01"
},
{
"start": 36.0,
"end": 38.5,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "Can you give me a specific example?",
"char_start": 427,
"char_end": 462,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s02"
},
{
"start": 38.5,
"end": 42.0,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "Where do soil erosion and enduro races intersect?",
"char_start": 463,
"char_end": 512,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s03"
},
{
"start": 42.0,
"end": 44.98,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "To be honest, speed comes from braking earlier and more smoothly, not from taking greater risks.",
"char_start": 527,
"char_end": 623,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s01"
},
{
"start": 44.98,
"end": 46.38,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "We've seen this with teams that use RockShox.",
"char_start": 624,
"char_end": 669,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s02"
},
{
"start": 46.38,
"end": 48.0,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "I've observed this pattern in three different teams.",
"char_start": 670,
"char_end": 722,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s03"
},
{
"start": 48.0,
"end": 50.41,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "I want to delve deeper into that.",
"char_start": 737,
"char_end": 770,
"unit_id": "t0006.u01",
"sent_id": "t0006.s01"
},
{
"start": 50.41,
"end": 54.0,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "Where do soil erosion and enduro races intersect?",
"char_start": 771,
"char_end": 820,
"unit_id": "t0006.u01",
"sent_id": "t0006.s02"
},
{
"start": 54.0,
"end": 54.31,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "Certainly.",
"char_start": 835,
"char_end": 845,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s01"
},
{
"start": 54.31,
"end": 57.56,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "Tire pressure and the choice of tire casing often matter more than a small adjustment to the suspension.",
"char_start": 846,
"char_end": 950,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s02"
},
{
"start": 57.56,
"end": 60.0,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "The context is important because it tells you what compromises you are making.",
"char_start": 951,
"char_end": 1029,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s03"
},
{
"start": 60.0,
"end": 61.61,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "Let's start there.",
"char_start": 1044,
"char_end": 1062,
"unit_id": "t0008.u01",
"sent_id": "t0008.s01"
},
{
"start": 61.61,
"end": 66.0,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "Where do soil erosion and enduro races intersect?",
"char_start": 1063,
"char_end": 1112,
"unit_id": "t0008.u01",
"sent_id": "t0008.s02"
},
{
"start": 66.0,
"end": 69.05,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "To be honest, risk management in racing isn't about avoiding crashes; it's about choosing which crashes you can survive.",
"char_start": 1127,
"char_end": 1247,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s01"
},
{
"start": 69.05,
"end": 70.17,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "We've seen this with teams that use Shimano.",
"char_start": 1248,
"char_end": 1292,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s02"
},
{
"start": 70.17,
"end": 72.0,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "If you ignore that, you'll have to rebuild it from scratch a year later.",
"char_start": 1293,
"char_end": 1365,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s03"
},
{
"start": 72.0,
"end": 78.0,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "Where does it break down?",
"char_start": 1380,
"char_end": 1405,
"unit_id": "t0010.u01",
"sent_id": "t0010.s01"
},
{
"start": 78.0,
"end": 81.21,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "The Cascadia Alliance is one of the platforms where this is clearly visible.",
"char_start": 1420,
"char_end": 1496,
"unit_id": "t0011.u01",
"sent_id": "t0011.s01"
},
{
"start": 81.21,
"end": 84.0,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "And the second-order effect is the part that most people overlook.",
"char_start": 1497,
"char_end": 1563,
"unit_id": "t0011.u01",
"sent_id": "t0011.s02"
},
{
"start": 84.0,
"end": 87.7,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "What is the heuristic (or guiding principle) that you always come back to?",
"char_start": 1578,
"char_end": 1652,
"unit_id": "t0012.u01",
"sent_id": "t0012.s01"
},
{
"start": 87.7,
"end": 90.0,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "How does Spoke & Wrench fit into this picture?",
"char_start": 1653,
"char_end": 1699,
"unit_id": "t0012.u01",
"sent_id": "t0012.s02"
},
{
"start": 90.0,
"end": 90.67,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "That's how I see it.",
"char_start": 1714,
"char_end": 1734,
"unit_id": "t0013.u01",
"sent_id": "t0013.s01"
},
{
"start": 90.67,
"end": 93.81,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "Erosion patterns on the track sections change the line choices between training and race day.",
"char_start": 1735,
"char_end": 1828,
"unit_id": "t0013.u01",
"sent_id": "t0013.s02"
},
{
"start": 120.0,
"end": 122.22,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "I want to delve deeper into that.",
"char_start": 1843,
"char_end": 1876,
"unit_id": "t0016.u01",
"sent_id": "t0016.s02"
},
{
"start": 122.22,
"end": 126.0,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "What is the version of the question that really matters?",
"char_start": 1877,
"char_end": 1933,
"unit_id": "t0016.u01",
"sent_id": "t0016.s03"
},
{
"start": 126.0,
"end": 127.25,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "I'm giving you the version that I truly believe in.",
"char_start": 1948,
"char_end": 1999,
"unit_id": "t0017.u01",
"sent_id": "t0017.s01"
},
{
"start": 127.25,
"end": 129.27,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "Speed comes from braking earlier and more smoothly, not from taking greater risks.",
"char_start": 2000,
"char_end": 2082,
"unit_id": "t0017.u01",
"sent_id": "t0017.s02"
},
{
"start": 129.27,
"end": 130.38,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "We've seen this with teams that use RockShox.",
"char_start": 2083,
"char_end": 2128,
"unit_id": "t0017.u01",
"sent_id": "t0017.s03"
},
{
"start": 130.38,
"end": 132.0,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "And the second-order effect is the part that most people overlook.",
"char_start": 2129,
"char_end": 2195,
"unit_id": "t0017.u01",
"sent_id": "t0017.s04"
},
{
"start": 132.0,
"end": 134.0,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "What does the error scenario look like?",
"char_start": 2210,
"char_end": 2249,
"unit_id": "t0018.u01",
"sent_id": "t0018.s01"
},
{
"start": 134.0,
"end": 138.0,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "What is the operational perspective that most listeners do not have access to?",
"char_start": 2250,
"char_end": 2328,
"unit_id": "t0018.u01",
"sent_id": "t0018.s02"
},
{
"start": 138.0,
"end": 141.56,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "Yes, so \u2013 tire pressure and the choice of tire casing often matter more than a small adjustment to the suspension.",
"char_start": 2343,
"char_end": 2457,
"unit_id": "t0019.u01",
"sent_id": "t0019.s01"
},
{
"start": 141.56,
"end": 144.0,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "The context is important because it tells you what compromises you are making.",
"char_start": 2458,
"char_end": 2536,
"unit_id": "t0019.u01",
"sent_id": "t0019.s02"
},
{
"start": 144.0,
"end": 145.95,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "Give me a specific example.",
"char_start": 2551,
"char_end": 2578,
"unit_id": "t0020.u01",
"sent_id": "t0020.s01"
},
{
"start": 145.95,
"end": 150.0,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "What is the version of the question that really matters?",
"char_start": 2579,
"char_end": 2635,
"unit_id": "t0020.u01",
"sent_id": "t0020.s02"
},
{
"start": 150.0,
"end": 153.25,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "Yes, so \u2013 risk management in racing isn't about avoiding crashes; it's about choosing which crashes are survivable.",
"char_start": 2650,
"char_end": 2765,
"unit_id": "t0021.u01",
"sent_id": "t0021.s01"
},
{
"start": 153.25,
"end": 154.53,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "We've seen this with teams that use RockShox.",
"char_start": 2766,
