"sent_id": "t0021.s02"
},
{
"start": 154.53,
"end": 156.0,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "I've observed this pattern in three different teams.",
"char_start": 2812,
"char_end": 2864,
"unit_id": "t0021.u01",
"sent_id": "t0021.s03"
},
{
"start": 156.0,
"end": 162.0,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "Tell me more about it.",
"char_start": 2879,
"char_end": 2901,
"unit_id": "t0022.u01",
"sent_id": "t0022.s01"
},
{
"start": 162.0,
"end": 165.04,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "The Cascadia Alliance is one of the platforms where this becomes clearly visible.",
"char_start": 2916,
"char_end": 2997,
"unit_id": "t0023.u01",
"sent_id": "t0023.s01"
},
{
"start": 165.04,
"end": 168.0,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "Once you understand this principle, the remaining decisions will become easier.",
"char_start": 2998,
"char_end": 3077,
"unit_id": "t0023.u01",
"sent_id": "t0023.s02"
},
{
"start": 168.0,
"end": 169.46,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "Let's start there.",
"char_start": 3092,
"char_end": 3110,
"unit_id": "t0024.u01",
"sent_id": "t0024.s01"
},
{
"start": 169.46,
"end": 174.0,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "What is the most underestimated aspect of enduro racing?",
"char_start": 3111,
"char_end": 3167,
"unit_id": "t0024.u01",
"sent_id": "t0024.s02"
},
{
"start": 174.0,
"end": 178.15,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "Ultimately, the erosion patterns on the track sections influence the choice of racing line between training and race day.",
"char_start": 3182,
"char_end": 3303,
"unit_id": "t0025.u01",
"sent_id": "t0025.s01"
},
{
"start": 178.15,
"end": 180.0,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "I have observed this pattern in three different teams.",
"char_start": 3304,
"char_end": 3358,
"unit_id": "t0025.u01",
"sent_id": "t0025.s02"
},
{
"start": 180.0,
"end": 186.0,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "Let's change the subject \u2013 I want to dedicate the final section to risk management.",
"char_start": 3373,
"char_end": 3456,
"unit_id": "t0026.u01",
"sent_id": "t0026.s01"
},
{
"start": 186.0,
"end": 192.0,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "That's where the conversation becomes interesting, because the compromises regarding risk management permeate everything we've discussed.",
"char_start": 3471,
"char_end": 3608,
"unit_id": "t0027.u01",
"sent_id": "t0027.s01"
},
{
"start": 192.0,
"end": 194.09,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
